  "body": "## What's Changed\n* chore: refresh AUR and site snapshot for 0.11.4 by @raythurman2386 in https://github.com/raythurman2386/muninn/pull/299\n* docs(i18n): record the upstream RTL landing by @raythurman2386 in https://github.com/raythurman2386/muninn/pull/300\n* deps(rune): bump the pin to 68d1f4dc for the RTL capability set by @raythurman2386 in https://github.com/raythurman2386/muninn/pull/302\n* fix(graph): pack the drawn card set at card spacing by @raythurman2386 in https://github.com/raythurman2386/muninn/pull/304\n* test(watch): outlast a loaded runner in the external-create wait by @raythurman2386 in https://github.com/raythurman2386/muninn/pull/305\n* fix(graph): keep settling while the layout is still improving by @raythurman2386 in https://github.com/raythurman2386/muninn/pull/306\n* Release 0.11.5 by @raythurman2386 in https://github.com/raythurman2386/muninn/pull/307\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/raythurman2386/muninn/compare/v0.11.4...v0.11.5",
